# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .env.nexus.local — Local development secrets
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# This file stores third-party API keys and credentials
# needed for local development (e.g. Proxmox API tokens,
# AWS access keys, HashiCorp Vault tokens, etc.).
#
# It is automatically excluded from Git via .git/info/exclude
# and must NEVER be committed to version control.
#
# Usage:
#   - Add key=value pairs below (no quotes needed)
#   - Source this file in your shell or devbox init hook:
#       source .env.nexus.local
#   - Or use it with tools that read .env files natively
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
